def public interest entity is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Def_PublicInterestEntity".

def public interest entity has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def public interest entity is a definition.

def public interest entity has the label "Definition: Public-Interest Entities".

def public interest entity has the definiendum "public-interest entities".

def public interest entity has the definiens "undertakings within the scope of Article 1 which are: (a) governed by the law of a Member State and whose transferable securities are admitted to trading on a regulated market of any Member State within the meaning of point (14) of Article 4(1) of Directive 2004/39/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 21 April 2004 on markets in financial instruments; (b) credit institutions as defined in point (1) of Article 4 of Directive 2006/48/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 14 June 2006 relating to the taking up and pursuit of the business of credit institutions, other than those referred to in Article 2 of that Directive; (c) insurance undertakings within the meaning of Article 2(1) of Council Directive 91/674/EEC of 19 December 1991 on the annual accounts of insurance undertakings; or (d) designated by Member States as public-interest entities, for instance undertakings that are of significant public relevance because of the nature of their business, their size or the number of their employees".

def public interest entity is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_1".


def participating interest is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Def_ParticipatingInterest".

def participating interest has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def participating interest is a definition.

def participating interest has the label "Definition: Participating Interest".

def participating interest has the definiendum "participating interest".

def participating interest has the definiens "rights in the capital of other undertakings, whether or not represented by certificates, which, by creating a durable link with those undertakings, are intended to contribute to the activities of the undertaking which holds those rights. The holding of part of the capital of another undertaking is presumed to constitute a participating interest where it exceeds a percentage threshold fixed by the Member States which is lower than or equal to 20 %".

def participating interest has the semantic flag true.

def participating interest is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_2".


def related party is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Def_RelatedParty".

def related party has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def related party is a definition.

def related party has the label "Definition: Related Party (by reference)".

def related party has the definiendum "related party".

def related party has the definiens "as defined in the international accounting standards adopted in accordance with Regulation (EC) No 1606/2002".

def related party has the semantic flag false.

def related party is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_3".


