def fixed assets has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def fixed assets is a definition.

def fixed assets has the label "Definition: Fixed Assets".

def fixed assets has the definiendum "fixed assets".

def fixed assets has the definiens "those assets which are intended for use on a continuing basis for the undertaking's activities".

def fixed assets has the semantic flag true.

def fixed assets is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_4".


def net turnover is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Def_NetTurnover".

def net turnover has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def net turnover is a definition.

def net turnover has the label "Definition: Net Turnover".

def net turnover has the definiendum "net turnover".

def net turnover has the definiens "the amounts derived from the sale of products and the provision of services after deducting sales rebates and value added tax and other taxes directly linked to turnover".

def net turnover has the semantic flag true.

def net turnover is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_5".

def net turnover has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def net turnover is a definition.

def net turnover has the label "Definition: Net Turnover".

def net turnover has the definiendum "net turnover".

def net turnover has the definiens "the amounts derived from the sale of products and the provision of services falling within the undertaking's ordinary activities, after deducting sales rebates and value added tax and other taxes directly linked to turnover.".

def net turnover has the semantic flag true.

def net turnover is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_3/par_12".


def purchase price is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Def_PurchasePrice".

def purchase price has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def purchase price is a definition.

def purchase price has the label "Definition: Purchase Price".

def purchase price has the definiendum "purchase price".

def purchase price has the definiens "the price payable and any incidental expenses minus any incidental reductions in the cost of acquisition".

def purchase price has the semantic flag true.

def purchase price is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_6".


def production cost is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Def_ProductionCost".

def production cost has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def production cost is a definition.

def production cost has the label "Definition: Production Cost".

def production cost has the definiendum "production cost".

def production cost has the definiens "the purchase price of raw materials, consumables and other costs directly attributable to the item in question. Member States shall permit or require the inclusion of a reasonable proportion of fixed or variable overhead costs indirectly attributable to the item in question, to the extent that they relate to the period of production. Distribution costs shall not be included".

def production cost has the semantic flag true.

def production cost is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_7".


