def value adjustment is a definition.

def value adjustment has the label "Definition: Value Adjustment".

def value adjustment has the definiendum "value adjustment".

def value adjustment has the definiens "the adjustments intended to take account of changes in the values of individual assets established at the balance sheet date, whether the change is final or not".

def value adjustment has the semantic flag true.

def value adjustment is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_8".


