def associated undertaking is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Def_AssociatedUndertaking".

def associated undertaking has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

def associated undertaking is a definition.

def associated undertaking has the label "Definition: Associated Undertaking".

def associated undertaking has the definiendum "associated undertaking".

def associated undertaking has the definiens "an undertaking in which another undertaking has a participating interest, and over whose operating and financial policies that other undertaking exercises significant influence. An undertaking is presumed to exercise a significant influence over another undertaking where it has 20 % or more of the shareholders' or members' voting rights in that other undertaking".

def associated undertaking has the semantic flag true.

def associated undertaking is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_13".


def investment undertakings is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Def_InvestmentUndertakings".

