def investment undertakings is a definition.

def investment undertakings has the label "Definition: Investment Undertakings".

def investment undertakings has the definiendum "investment undertakings".

def investment undertakings has the definiens "undertakings the sole object of which is to invest their funds in various securities, real property and other assets, with the sole aim of spreading investment risks and giving their shareholders the benefit of the results of the management of their assets; and undertakings associated with investment undertakings with fixed capital, if the sole object of those associated undertakings is to acquire fully paid shares issued by those investment undertakings without prejudice to point (h) of Article 22(1) of Directive 2012/30/EU".

def investment undertakings has the semantic flag true.

def investment undertakings is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/pnt_14".


