requirement art 3 par 6 medium group definition has the label "Article 3(6) - Medium-sized Groups Definition".

requirement art 3 par 6 medium group definition has the digital dimension observation.

requirement art 3 par 6 medium group definition defines def medium sized group.

requirement art 3 par 6 medium group definition is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_3/par_6".

requirement art 3 par 6 medium group definition has the legal text "Medium-sized groups shall be groups which are not small groups, which consist of parent and subsidiary undertakings to be included in a consolidation and which, on a consolidated basis, do not exceed the limits of at least two of the three following criteria on the balance sheet date of the parent undertaking:
(a) balance sheet total: EUR 20 000 000;
(b) net turnover: EUR 40 000 000;
(c) average number of employees during the financial year: 250.".

requirement art 3 par 6 medium group definition has the comment "Constitutive rule defining medium-sized groups by consolidated size thresholds (€20M balance sheet, €40M turnover, 250 employees).".


