requirement art 3 par 7 large group definition has the comment "Constitutive rule defining large groups by consolidated size thresholds (€20M balance sheet, €40M turnover, 250 employees).".


requirement art 3 par 8 set off provision is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art3_Par8_SetOffProvision".

requirement art 3 par 8 set off provision has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 3 par 8 set off provision is a constitutive rule.

requirement art 3 par 8 set off provision has the label "Article 3(8) - Set-off Provision in Consolidation".

requirement art 3 par 8 set off provision is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_3/par_8".

requirement art 3 par 8 set off provision has the legal text "In the case of a group consisting of parent and subsidiary undertakings to be included in a consolidation, the balance sheet total, net turnover and average number of employees as well as the limits of paragraphs 5, 6 and 7 of this Article shall be calculated on a consolidated basis, in accordance with Articles 22 to 29 and points (b) and (h) of Article 30(8), but disregarding Article 30(1) to (7). In the case of a consolidated balance sheet and a consolidated profit and loss account, the figures relating to the parent undertaking's balance sheet or profit and loss account, as the case may be, shall be left out, but without prejudice to the set-off referred to in Article 30(1)(g).".

requirement art 3 par 8 set off provision has the comment "Constitutive rule specifying how to calculate group size thresholds for consolidation purposes.".


requirement art 3 par 9 currency conversion is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art3_Par9_CurrencyConversion".

requirement art 3 par 9 currency conversion has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 3 par 9 currency conversion is a constitutive rule.

requirement art 3 par 9 currency conversion has the label "Article 3(9) - Currency Conversion Rules".

requirement art 3 par 9 currency conversion is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_3/par_9".

requirement art 3 par 9 currency conversion has the legal text "For the purposes of paragraphs 1 to 7, the balance sheet total, net turnover and average number of employees of an undertaking or a group which does not have the euro as its currency shall be determined by applying the exchange rates at the balance sheet date applicable to the translation of the balance sheet into euros. Where on the balance sheet date there is no exchange rate applicable to such translation, the most recent exchange rate applicable to the translation of the balance sheet shall apply.".

requirement art 3 par 9 currency conversion has the comment "Constitutive rule specifying how to convert non-euro amounts for threshold calculations.".


requirement art 3 par 10 consecutive years rule is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art3_Par10_ConsecutiveYearsRule".

requirement art 3 par 10 consecutive years rule has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 3 par 10 consecutive years rule is a constitutive rule.

requirement art 3 par 10 consecutive years rule has the label "Article 3(10) - Two Consecutive Years Rule".

requirement art 3 par 10 consecutive years rule is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_3/par_10".

requirement art 3 par 10 consecutive years rule has the legal text "Undertakings and groups shall qualify as small, medium-sized or large, where, on their balance sheet dates, they exceed or cease to exceed the limits of two of the three criteria specified in paragraphs 1 to 7 of this Article. This shall apply to undertakings and groups in respect of two consecutive financial years.".

requirement art 3 par 10 consecutive years rule has the comment "Constitutive rule specifying that threshold changes apply only after two consecutive years.".


requirement art 3 par 11 balance sheet total definition is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art3_Par11_BalanceSheetTotalDefinition".

requirement art 3 par 11 balance sheet total definition has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 3 par 11 balance sheet total definition is a constitutive rule.

requirement art 3 par 11 balance sheet total definition has the label "Article 3(11) - Balance Sheet Total Definition".

requirement art 3 par 11 balance sheet total definition defines def balance sheet total.

requirement art 3 par 11 balance sheet total definition is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_3/par_11".

requirement art 3 par 11 balance sheet total definition has the legal text "For the purpose of this Directive 'balance sheet total' shall comprise those assets that are to be shown in accordance with point (A) of the general provisions of Articles 9 and 10.".

requirement art 3 par 11 balance sheet total definition has the comment "Constitutive rule defining what is included in balance sheet total.".


requirement art 3 par 12 annual threshold calculation is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art3_Par12_AnnualThresholdCalculation".

requirement art 3 par 12 annual threshold calculation has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 3 par 12 annual threshold calculation is a constitutive rule.

requirement art 3 par 12 annual threshold calculation has the label "Article 3(12) - Annual Threshold Calculation".

requirement art 3 par 12 annual threshold calculation defines def net turnover.

requirement art 3 par 12 annual threshold calculation is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_3/par_12".

requirement art 3 par 12 annual threshold calculation has the legal text "Where, on its balance sheet date, an undertaking or a group exceeds or ceases to exceed the limits of two of the three criteria specified in paragraphs 1 to 7 of this Article, that fact shall affect the application of those paragraphs only if it occurs for two consecutive financial years. Net turnover shall comprise the amounts derived from the sale of products and the provision of services falling within the undertaking's ordinary activities, after deducting sales rebates and value added tax and other taxes directly linked to turnover.".

requirement art 3 par 12 annual threshold calculation has the comment "Constitutive rule specifying annual threshold calculation with net turnover definition.".


requirement art 3 par 13 commission review thresholds is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art3_Par13_CommissionReviewThresholds".

