requirement art 19 par 1 management report content is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art19_Par1_ManagementReportContent".

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content is a prescriptive rule.

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content has the label "Article 19(1) - Management Report Content".

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content has the modality obligation.

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_d98a69b9".

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content has the digital dimension data.

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content defines def management report.

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content defines def key performance indicators.

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content produces action art 19 prepare management report.

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_19/par_1".

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content has the legal text "The management report shall include a fair review of the development and performance of the undertaking's business and of its position, together with a description of the principal risks and uncertainties that it faces.

The review shall be a balanced and comprehensive analysis of the development and performance of the undertaking's business and of its position, consistent with the size and complexity of the business.

To the extent necessary for an understanding of the undertaking's development, performance or position, the analysis shall include both financial and, where appropriate, non-financial key performance indicators relevant to the particular business, including information relating to environmental and employee matters. In providing the analysis, the management report shall, where appropriate, include references to, and additional explanations of, amounts reported in the annual financial statements.".

requirement art 19 par 1 management report content has the comment "Obligation to include fair review, balanced analysis, and key performance indicators in management report.".


requirement art 19 par 2 additional info is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art19_Par2_AdditionalInfo".

requirement art 19 par 2 additional info has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 19 par 2 additional info is a prescriptive rule.

requirement art 19 par 2 additional info has the label "Article 19(2) - Additional Information in Management Report".

requirement art 19 par 2 additional info has the modality obligation.

requirement art 19 par 2 additional info has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_d98a69b9".

