requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art30_Par1_PublicationObligation".

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation is a prescriptive rule.

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation has the label "Article 30(1) - General Publication Obligation".

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation has the modality obligation.

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_d98a69b9".

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation has the digital dimension digital public service.

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation produces action art 30 publish.

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_30/par_1".

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation has the legal text "Member States shall ensure that undertakings publish within a reasonable period of time, which shall not exceed 12 months after the balance sheet date, the duly approved annual financial statements and the management report, together with the opinion submitted by the statutory auditor or audit firm referred to in Article 34 of this Directive, as laid down by the laws of each Member State in accordance with Chapter 2 of Directive 2009/101/EC.

Member States may, however, exempt undertakings from the obligation to publish the management report where a copy of all or part of any such report can be easily obtained upon request at a price not exceeding its administrative cost.".

requirement art 30 par 1 publication obligation has the comment "Obligation for Member States to ensure undertakings publish financial statements, management report, and auditor opinion within 12 months, with optional exemption for management report.".


requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art30_Par2_ExemptAnnexII".

requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii is a prescriptive rule.

requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii has the label "Article 30(2) - Exemption for Annex II Undertakings".

requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii has the modality permission.

requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii produces action art 30 exempt annex ii from publication.

requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_30/par_2".

requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii has the legal text "Member States may exempt an undertaking referred to in Annex II to which the coordination measures prescribed by this Directive apply by virtue of point (b) of Article 1(1) from publishing its financial statements in accordance with Article 3 of Directive 2009/101/EC, provided that those financial statements are available to the public at its head office, in the following cases:

(a) all the members of the undertaking concerned that have unlimited liability are undertakings referred to in Annex I governed by the laws of Member States other than the Member State whose law governs that undertaking, and none of those undertakings publishes the financial statements of the undertaking concerned with its own financial statements;

(b) all the members of the undertaking concerned that have unlimited liability are undertakings which are not governed by the laws of a Member State but which have a legal form comparable to those referred to in Directive 2009/101/EC.

Copies of the financial statements shall be obtainable upon request. The price of such a copy may not exceed its administrative cost.".

requirement art 30 par 2 exempt annex ii has the comment "Permission for Member States to exempt Annex II undertakings from publication requirements under specific conditions regarding unlimited liability members.".


requirement art 30 par 3 consolidated statements is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art30_Par3_ConsolidatedStatements".

