requirement art 31 par 2 permit medium sized abridged is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/financial-reporting#Requirement_Art31_Par2_PermitMediumSizedAbridged".

requirement art 31 par 2 permit medium sized abridged has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

