requirement art 53 par 2 communicate text has the legal text "Member States shall communicate to the Commission the text of the main provisions of national law which they adopt in the field covered by this Directive.".

requirement art 53 par 2 communicate text has the comment "Obligation to communicate text of national law provisions to Commission.".


